meta {
  name: 03-Try filtering by location (Yaba)
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/listings?location=Yaba&priceMax=1000000&bedrooms=1&page=0&size=20
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  I'm trying my luck — typing what I'd hope works. As a Lagos
  renter the first thing I do on Jiji or PropertyPro is filter by
  area + budget. The spec doesn't document `location`, `priceMax`,
  or `bedrooms` on this endpoint, so this is most likely going to
  return an unfiltered page of everything.

  If that's the case, the entire discovery experience for me as a
  first-timer is "scroll until you spot Yaba in an address string,"
  which is unworkable on a real Lagos catalogue.
}
